# Release signing — the release keystore is intentionally IN this repo
# (see README "Signing" section): UMBRA is a personal sideloaded utility and
# signature continuity across rebuilds matters more than key secrecy here.
# Rotate (and switch to a local git-ignored key) if this ever becomes a
# widely-distributed app.
#!keystore/*

